    silk: { cap: 'Samarkand, Central Asia', ll: [66.97, 39.65], tx: 'It is linked to every Place.', fact: 'It was not one road but a web of trade routes linking China and the Mediterranean.', art: 'A caravan city on the Silk Road: a crowded market under striped awnings, bolts of silk and spice sacks, camels arriving through a tiled gate, mountains beyond.' },
